        "subheading_3": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Maren started growing food on a third floor balcony with two pots of tomatoes and a bag of compost she carried up the stairs. Nine years later she grows most of her family's summer vegetables on a rented terrace and one shared raised bed.</p><p>For eight years she has run the beginners' class at her community garden. Smallplot is that class, filmed over a whole season. This is sample text. Replace it with your own story.</p>"
