            "text": "Why the course exists"
          }
        },
        "heading_2": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Growing books assume you have a garden"
          }
        },
        "subheading_3": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Most growing advice is written for long beds and a shed. People in flats and terraced houses kept asking the same questions in class: which pot, how much sun, what to do about the wind on the fourth floor. The course answers those first.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
