            "label": "01",
            "heading": "Small is easier",
            "text": "<p>A balcony you look after every day grows more than a big bed you visit on Sundays.</p>"
          }
        },
        "column_3": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "label": "02",
            "heading": "One job a week",
            "text": "<p>Gardening falls apart when everything is urgent. The season has an order, and the course follows it.</p>"
          }
        },
        "column_4": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "label": "03",
            "heading": "No sprays",
            "text": "<p>Nets, timing and a few flowers do the work. Nothing in the course needs a chemical.</p>"
          }
